one of the things we talk about is the  best spider-man stories are when Peter  and spider-man's worlds collide  it's been a thrill working on spider-man  for the first time and doing it with our  longtime partners at Playstation their  Sony interactive entertainment  spider-man is a character that is super  beloved by many people and Omni Act  myself included and we also know that he  has millions of fans around the world  it's one of the most beloved characters  of all of media period so we felt a lot  of responsibility to try and make a  great experience for players and  but focus really hard on bringing you a  kind of a fresh spider-man experience  that respects the DNA of the series and  feels right but also will surprise you  in new ways and it starts with the fact  that this is not an origin story this is  not based on a comic current movie it's  a brand new experience starting a  23-year old Peter Parker who is  masterful at fighting crime and  it's gonna have some great personal  relationships you're gonna see the  Peters side of it and you're also going  to see the spider-man side so I don't  think it was really hard to decide that  we wanted to you know take the best  things and our favorite things from past  spider-man comics and lore there's so  much good stuff over you know decades  you have all these great characters and  spider-man has been in so many different  situations and bought so many villains  and fans have many favorite moments and  so we wanted to honor that legacy and  try and do things that we as fans would  want to see while also providing a lot  of Easter eggs for fans as well but we  weren't just thinking it had to be all  classic I mean if you look at the choice  of mr. negatives he's a very modern  spider-man villain Dan Slott created him  I think nine years ago maybe 10 now so  he's relatively newcomer and if you  haven't been keeping up with the comics  you may have no idea who he is so it's  great to bring him to potentially his  largest audience yet it was really  important to us to you know tell a story  that we wanted to tell we have amazing  ideas we love spider-man and his fans if  we were gonna sit down and play like a  new  big spider-man game we would want  something that would you know feel like  very much like spider-man but at the  same time be surprising and so it was  kind of just us knowing that if we were  gonna play this game it's what we would  want  creating a 23 year old Peter Parker  allowed us a lot of things that we  couldn't have gotten with a 15 year old  one firstly he's already great at  fighting crimes so we can let players be  awesome at being spider-man this isn't a  game where he's trying to learn his  powers and figure out how to web-swing  and not being good at fighting guys we  can throw you right into the deep end  into some crazy situations because you  are a masterful spider-man who's been  spider-man for eight years on top of  that there's sort of high school  relationships that you have that the  classic 15 year old Peter Parker  explores we wanted to sort of explore  what those relationships what your  relationships are and what your life is  like after you get out of university and  you start a job while also trying to be  a superhero  it's a classic thing about spider-man is  how to handle a next step of life and  that's something that Peter always has  dealt with whether he's been in high  school or he's in college we're just  doing that for what it's like when you  finally are an adult well New York is  this like melting pot of cultures so we  wanted to reflect that as accurately as  we could and there's kind of a very  large Chinatown district one of these  characters to still be very authentic to  who they were like just because our  Peter Parker is 23 years old he still  should act and feel like Peter Parker  and maybe people are wearing are in  different jobs like MJ is a reporter at  The Daily Bugle or Norman Osborn as the  mayor but we still want them to be true  to their actual characters and true to  the character traits that have been  defined for them so that's kind of how  we're blending things and and I think  showing other cultures especially as it  relates to kingpin or to the city of New  York or to mr. negative is just  important to be authentic to their to  those characters and that universe so we  have Marvel's New York the island of  Manhattan after the first mission you  can just swing around and see the whole  swing everywhere all the way from  financial district up to Harlem we  wanted to have a really detailed city  that feels doesn't just look like New  York but feels like it when you're in it  this is not a dark abandoned city it's  got you know pedestrians and traffic so  as you explore the city there will be  additional activities for you to do some  of these are little collectibles like  Peter leaves backpacks everywhere when  he goes to fight crimes and then he  forgets where they are each one has like  a different piece of memorabilia so to  speak that kind of tells you a little  bit about the story of his first eight  years of spider-man there's other  collectibles too like there's landmarks  that Peter can take photos of there are  stakeouts that black cat has been up to  but then there's also side quests and  some interesting side missions a big  game and it will depend a lot on how  much site content you do but even if you  don't do a lot of the side content  there's still a very satisfying and long  story there for him but one that I  really think is interesting and we tried  to make Tye story and everything where  we could is there are these research  stations that Harry Osborn set up as a  project to help clean up New York now  Harry is currently away he parries  Peters best friend he's currently away  in Europe pepper studying in school and  so he asked Peter to check in on his  research stations for him but little  does Harry know that actually spider-man  is doing the checking in and using some  special web powers to help  do the research that Harry was trying to  get done we're huge fans of spider-man  and insomniac so we've been working hard  on this for over three and a half years  we poured a lot of energy and effort  into it we're very excited for you all  to play the game try to avoid spoilers  did a lot of little surprises and big  surprise is still left to be discovered  and we can't wait for you all to play it  on September 7
 

